{"id":"biblioteca.archivos","number":"12.7","kind":"concepto","title":[{"type":"text","text":"Files and folders"}],"phrase":[{"type":"text","text":"To read or write files you ask for a folder capability, open the file with it, and every operation returns a "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Resultado","type"]]},{"type":"text","text":" that may carry an "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["ErrorES","type"]]},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"blocks":[{"type":"callout","kind":"phrase","collapsible":false,"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"To read or write files you ask for a folder capability, open the file with it, and every operation returns a "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Resultado","type"]]},{"type":"text","text":" that may carry an "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["ErrorES","type"]]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"type":"heading","id":"funciona","number":"12.7.1","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"How it works"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"The path is always the same:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"entries":[[{"type":"code","tokens":[["SolicitarDirectorio","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],["path","identifier"],[")","punctuation"]]},{"type":"text","text":" gives a "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["DirectorioCap","type"]]},{"type":"text","text":" for that folder."}],[{"type":"code","tokens":[["folder","identifier"],[".","punctuation"],["Abrir","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],["name","identifier"],[",","punctuation"],[" "],["mode","identifier"],[")","punctuation"]]},{"type":"text","text":" gives a "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["ArchivoCap","type"]]},{"type":"text","text":", with mode "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["\"lectura\"","literalString"]]},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["\"escritura\"","literalString"]]},{"type":"text","text":"."}],[{"type":"code","tokens":[["LeerTexto","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["EscribirTexto","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["AgregarTexto","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":" and their "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Bytes","type"]]},{"type":"text","text":" versions do the work."}]]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Every step can fail, so it returns "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Resultado","type"],["<","operator"],["…"],[",","punctuation"],[" "],["ErrorES","type"],[">","operator"]]},{"type":"text","text":". With "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Propagar","keywordStructured"]]},{"type":"text","text":", a failure is returned to the caller without writing the "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Segun","keywordStructured"]]},{"type":"text","text":" by hand."}]},{"type":"figure","id":"archivo-capas","number":"12.7-1","alt":"From folder to contents","description":"DirCap leads with open to FileCap, which leads with readText to the contents \"Comprar pan\". Every step can end in Error(IoError).","caption":[{"type":"text","text":"From folder to file and from file to contents. Every arrow is an operation that may fail with an "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["ErrorES","type"]]},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 170\" width=\"340\" height=\"170\"><title>From folder to contents</title><desc>DirCap leads with open to FileCap, which leads with readText to the contents &quot;Comprar pan&quot;. Every step can end in Error(IoError).</desc><rect x=\"6\" y=\"20\" width=\"100\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FF0004\" fill-opacity=\"0.12\" stroke=\"#FF0004\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"46.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexMono\" fill=\"#FF0001\">DirectorioCap</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"20\" width=\"100\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FF0004\" fill-opacity=\"0.18\" stroke=\"#FF0004\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"46.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexMono\" fill=\"#FF0001\">ArchivoCap</text><rect x=\"234\" y=\"20\" width=\"100\" height=\"4